  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:closureNote "Independently reverified fixed by req-qa and arch-qa at fix/am-phase-end-critical-review@1125597c (commit 9852bfcb). docs/plans/phase-am/am1-removal-ledger.md's Status line now reads 'frozen closeout ledger (2026-08-11)'; the freeze checklist item is checked and records the accepted AM6 evidence SHA 6a7e0e0399ef782176e0d20d7d593942154e0598, cross-checked and confirmed to match the identical SHA used in am6-closure-proof.md's Dynamic Evidence table for the M5 localhost/same-host/cross-host smoke and admission-capacity benchmark rows -- genuine evidence-backed data, not a placeholder. Every item in both the ledger's Refresh task list and its AM.1-AM.6 critical-review task list is checked." ;
